  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>has many solutions&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;Minimum of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn></math></p>",
